#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:5
#: e7018f32ca4c42ee8b7d4eea81df04bf
msgid "Pomegranate Systems CAN/DroneCAN Power Module"
msgstr "Pomegranate Systems CAN/DroneCAN 电源模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:11
#: 2181228862034636a35e6769bfe796e0
msgid ""
"Intelligent power monitor, accurate fuel gauge, and efficient 5V/2A power "
"supply with a CANbus interface."
msgstr "智能电源监控器、精确电量计，以及带 CANbus 接口的高效 5V/2A 电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:13
#: cbce7959dfd14c41aadc1a267a2dabb5
msgid ""
"High-resolution current and voltage monitoring with state of charge "
"integration."
msgstr "高分辨率电流和电压监控，带电量积分功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:14
#: 1f6230f032664298a22c38c8962e3d23
msgid "Power monitoring for battery, 5V, and 3V rails."
msgstr "支持电池、5V 和 3V 电源轨的电源监控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:15
#: b6fcbff45a4d49f190cac62d8a4e22e7
msgid ""
"Supports 2-6S batteries (6-26V) and currents of up to 100A, when actively "
"cooled."
msgstr "支持 2-6S 电池（6-26V），主动冷却时电流最高可达 100A。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:16
#: 42be8a7877114ee3b3655e29d41e7b21
msgid ""
"CANbus interface using DroneCAN v0 protocol (PX4 / ArduPilot Compatible)."
msgstr "使用 DroneCAN v0 协议的 CANbus 接口（兼容 PX4/ArduPilot）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:17
#: 1bf2064722ab4532b6b6387f3ed2c135
msgid ""
"Efficient 5V switching regulator provides up to 2A of low noise current."
msgstr "高效 5V 开关稳压器，可提供最高 2A 的低噪声电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:18
#: eb3bd617108b48e5a91b63254db78356
msgid "Daytime visible state of charge LED"
msgstr "白天可见的电量指示 LED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:19
#: ea178555a7ca47a99a57365f670c4a07
msgid "Electronic CANbus termination simplifies wiring."
msgstr "电子 CANbus 终端简化了布线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:20
#: aa6cb1adc89548678dc6da4a6e32b81f
msgid "Multiple modules on the same bus can monitor multiple power sources."
msgstr "同一总线上的多个模块可监控多个电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:21
#: 36a51f393a6b4b3da0500207ef7505dc
msgid ""
"Board-mounted battery connectors and M2.5 mounting holes provide a robust "
"battery entry point."
msgstr "板载电池接口和 M2.5 安装孔提供了牢固的电池连接点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:22
#: 1814a3d155ca45b9ad4eda66540fc008
msgid "Open Source Firmware"
msgstr "开源固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pomegranate-systems-pm.rst:25
#: 2b81815d03944a7b8c30430ac4b06e20
msgid "Configuration and Setup"
msgstr "配置与设置"

